{"id":980,"bodyHtml":"<DIV><div><p>为深化校企合作，拓宽毕业生就业渠道，12月8日，中北大学机械工程学院辅导员王慧慧、李红丹赴福建省厦门市开展访企拓岗专项活动，先后走访了厦门研究院及厦门大力神起重机有限公司。在走访过程中，两位老师深入了解了企业的技术发展、业务布局及实际人才需求，并就学院人才培养模式、专业设置、实习实践基地建设等议题与企业方进行了深入交流和探讨。</p><p></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=onzCuPMmNsM8C4MUlC8nR9YMmv4MNVnVUNCsnNM2nml8L770gihFp2hmCIa0UShRMYhfUShfU4NDUNVVnl78UmCYLlLaLRNanz7Po7CZLznFL4WfUzGaU8QFLNCaU8LJqjfjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPoR7ag4LPL4CsgtA8pUScc&oid=1069369254&tid=1810&nid=31367&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/AC7AAAC96BAEEA4B621C0090E118F814/32AA00CF/2F0CC\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=onzCuPMmNsM8C4MUlC8nR9YMmv4MNVnVUNCsnNM2nml8L770gihFp2hmCIa0UShRMYhfUShfU4NDUNVVnl78UmCYLlLaLRNanz7Po7CZLznFL4WfUzGaU8QFLNCaU8LJqjfjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPoR7ag4LPL4CsgtA8pUScc&oid=1069369254&tid=1810&nid=31367&e=.jpg\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=oozGubMlCbMRUYnUNMVnRTkU4VVnmGn4MmlanR74Um7an7l0gihFp2hmCIa0MSh2USy4nkhRL8Canzv4M7l4MN-ZM4MfnRrfLR67Um-sLlQFM77aL4UbLNnFL8-ZoR7Jqjfjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPoR7ag4LPL4CsgtA8pUScc&oid=1069369254&tid=1810&nid=31367&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/5FA3DC3F0E734E36B873AD5A07DB271F/4A03492D/3B881\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=oozGubMlCbMRUYnUNMVnRTkU4VVnmGn4MmlanR74Um7an7l0gihFp2hmCIa0MSh2USy4nkhRL8Canzv4M7l4MN-ZM4MfnRrfLR67Um-sLlQFM77aL4UbLNnFL8-ZoR7Jqjfjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPoR7ag4LPL4CsgtA8pUScc&oid=1069369254&tid=1810&nid=31367&e=.jpg\"></p><p><br></p><p>走访期间，调研组还与在厦工作校友——由国森、王福云进行了亲切座谈。两位校友分享了自身职业发展体会，并从行业视角对学院课程优化、学生能力培养提出了宝贵建议。此次走访不仅为毕业生挖掘了更多优质岗位资源，也为学院后续优化育人方案、增强校企协同奠定了坚实基础。</p><p><br></p></div><BR><BR></DIV>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://jxdl.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=onzCuPMmNsM8C4MUlC8nR9YMmv4MNVnVUNCsnNM2nml8L770gihFp2hmCIa0UShRMYhfUShfU4NDUNVVnl78UmCYLlLaLRNanz7Po7CZLznFL4WfUzGaU8QFLNCaU8LJqjfjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPoR7ag4LPL4CsgtA8pUScc&oid=1069369254&tid=1810&nid=31367&e=.jpg"}